      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which Kérastase shampoo is best for hair fall?",
            "content": "<p>For hair fall from breakage and weakened fibers, the Genesis shampoo — in <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-genesis-anti-hair-fall-fortifying-shampoo-for-thin-hair\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Genesis Anti Hair-Fall Fortifying Shampoo for Thin Hair at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Thin Hair</a> and <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-genesis-anti-hair-fall-fortifying-shampoo-for-thick-hair\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Genesis Anti Hair-Fall Fortifying Shampoo for Thick Hair 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Thick Hair</a> variants. When the fall is triggered by the scalp, the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-specifique-bain-prevention-shampoo-250ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Spécifique Prévention Anti-Hairloss Shampoo 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Spécifique Prévention Anti-Hairloss Shampoo</a> is the daily preventive cleanse. If you're unsure, begin with Genesis — both are available at HairMNL.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Spécifique help with hair loss?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — specifically the hair loss that stems from scalp dysfunction: oily roots, sensitivity, or dandruff. Its anti-hairloss trio is the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-specifique-bain-prevention-shampoo-250ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Spécifique Prévention Anti-Hairloss Shampoo 250ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Prévention shampoo</a>, the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-specifique-stimuliste-spray-125ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Spécifique Stimuliste Anti-Hairloss Spray 125ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Stimuliste Anti-Hairloss Spray</a>, and the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-specifique-potentialiste-serum\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Spécifique Potentialiste Balancing Scalp Serum 90ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Potentialiste scalp serum</a>. It is not built for breakage-driven fall — for shedding without an underlying scalp condition, Genesis is the more targeted line.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between Stimuliste and the Genesis serum?",
            "content": "<p>Both are daily, no-rinse anti-hairfall leave-ons — one per line. The <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-genesis-anti-hair-fall-fortifying-serum\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Genesis Anti Hair-Fall Fortifying Serum at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Genesis serum</a> reinforces the hair fiber (Aminexil, ginger root, Edelweiss) so strands stop snapping; the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-specifique-stimuliste-spray-125ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Spécifique Stimuliste Anti-Hairloss Spray 125ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Stimuliste spray</a> is nutri-energising scalp care that stimulates hair production, improves density and substance, and helps protect the follicle from premature aging. Breakage-driven fall wants Genesis; scalp-driven thinning wants Stimuliste.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does hair fall out after stopping Kérastase Genesis?",
            "content": "<p>Genesis is a maintenance treatment, not a one-time cure. Stopping use can allow baseline hair fall to return as the fortifying support fades, so it is best kept as an ongoing routine rather than a short course.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use both Genesis and Spécifique together?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — they treat different layers of the same problem. Use Spécifique for the cleansing and scalp-treatment steps, then the Genesis serum as the leave-on that fortifies the fiber: Prévention shampoo → Stimuliste or Potentialiste on the scalp → Genesis serum at the roots. The <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/pages/scalp-quiz\" title=\"HairMNL Scalp Quiz\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">scalp quiz</a>, or a Kérastase professional, can fine-tune it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Kérastase Genesis safe for colored or rebonded hair?",
            "content": "<p>Yes — Genesis is formulated for all hair, chemically treated included. The one proviso: if the rebond has irritated your scalp, settle that irritation with Spécifique first, then layer Genesis on top.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
